hpc:Slurmctld a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Component ;
    rdfs:comment "Slurm Controller Daemon" ;
    hpc:SlurmctldPort rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Slurmctld ;
    rdfs:range xsd:integer .

hpc:Slurmd a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Component ;
    rdfs:comment "Slurm Job Manager Daemon" ;
    hpc:SlurmdPort rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Slurmd ;
    rdfs:range xsd:integer .

hpc:Slurmdbd a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Component ;
    rdfs:comment "Slurm Database Daemon" ;
    hpc:DbdPort rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Slurmdbd ;
    rdfs:range xsd:integer .

# Communication Properties
hpc:CommunicatesWith rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Component ;
    rdfs:range hpc:Component .

# IPv4 and IPv6 Communication Properties
hpc:CommunicatesWithIPv4 rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Component ;
    rdfs:range xsd:boolean .

hpc:CommunicatesWithIPv6 rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Component ;
    rdfs:range xsd:boolean .
```

This ontology fragment represents the Slurm Workload Manager components (Slurmctld, Slurmd, and Slurmdbd) and their communication properties. It also includes properties for IPv4 and IPv6 communication.
